{#
  Links on this page are ABSOLUTE, not piped through `rel`, and that is deliberate.

  GitHub Pages serves this one file for a miss at ANY depth. The `rel` filter
  computes its `../` prefix from this page's own url (/404.html, depth 1), so a
  miss at /skills/anything/ would resolve "Back to overview" to /skills/ and
  every card below to a sibling that does not exist. Absolute URLs are the only
  form that survives being served from an arbitrary path.

  This is the one page in the site where the mount-point portability that
  `_filters/rel-url.cjs` exists to protect has to be traded away, because the
  page's whole job is to work when the path is wrong.
#}
